{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2021-11-08 07:00:00', 'title': 'ASURAGEN LAUNCHES NEW KIT TO ENABLE BROADER COVERAGE OF GENE VARIANTS LINKED TO CYSTIC FIBROSIS', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS, NOV. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ:TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ASURAGEN, INC., A BIO-TECHNE BRAND, HAS LAUNCHED A NEW KIT TO DETECT PATHOGENIC VARIANTS IN THE CFTR GENE. THE AMPLIDEX®\xa0PCR/CE\xa0CFTR\xa0KIT, INTENDED FOR RESEARCH USE ONLY, PROVIDES BROADER COVERAGE OF THE DIVERSE U.S. POPULATION1,2 THAN ANY OTHER COMMERCIALLY AVAILABLE, TARGETED\xa0CFTR\xa0TESTING ASSAY.'}